  <name>InputWeave</name>
  <summary>Use one keyboard and mouse with all your computers</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="zh-TW">多台電腦共用一組鍵盤滑鼠</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      InputWeave lets the computers on your desk share one keyboard and
      mouse. Move the pointer off the edge of a screen and it appears on the
      computer next to it. Copy on one computer and paste on another, and
      send files between them. It works with InputWeave on macOS and Windows.
    </p>
    <p xml:lang="zh-TW">
      InputWeave 讓桌上的幾台電腦共用一組鍵盤滑鼠：游標移出螢幕邊緣，就會出現在旁邊那台電腦上；在一台複製，到另一台直接貼上，也能互傳檔案。可以和 macOS、Windows 上的 InputWeave 一起使用。
    </p>
  </description>
  <url type="homepage">https://inputweave.ctsite.cc/</url>
